1
00:00:00,442 --> 00:00:03,842
(Penny:)Nobody knows.
That's why he's number one.

2
00:00:05,146 --> 00:00:07,246
(Penny:)Can you please go talk
to him?

3
00:00:07,249 --> 00:00:10,079
(Leonard:)Come on. I take care of him all
day long. You do it for once.

4
00:00:10,085 --> 00:00:13,155
(Penny:)Once? Who got the gum
out of his hair?

5
00:00:13,154 --> 00:00:16,854
(Leonard:)What do you want, a medal?
It was your gum.

6
00:00:16,858 --> 00:00:19,858
(Amy:)Fine.
(groans)

7
00:00:19,861 --> 00:00:20,991
(Leonard:)I love you.

8
00:00:20,996 --> 00:00:22,366
(Penny:)Who cares?

9
00:00:22,364 --> 00:00:25,134
(tune repeating)

10
00:00:25,133 --> 00:00:27,103
SHELDON: What are you
doing in my room? I...

11
00:00:27,102 --> 00:00:29,972
(banging on keys; discordant notes sounding)
Stop it! That's mine!

12
00:00:29,971 --> 00:00:32,871
Why are you so strong?!

13
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,610
(keyboard plays discordant notes)
Problem solved.

14
00:00:37,612 --> 00:00:39,342
(groans)

15
00:00:39,347 --> 00:00:41,247
(grunts)

16
00:00:41,249 --> 00:00:42,379
(sighs)

17
00:00:42,384 --> 00:00:46,984
(tune playing on tuba
in distance)

18
00:00:48,556 --> 00:00:50,386
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah,
he got a tuba.

19
00:00:50,392 --> 00:00:52,592
(tune repeats)

20
00:00:57,762 --> 00:01:01,762
(Sheldon:)Dear Crazy Future Sheldon...

